  "root_cause_analysis": "The model prioritized clarifying ambiguous input (Rivermist location) over executing state-independent tool calls. Per vehicle_control_api delta4 and message_api delta1, state-modifying and information-retrieval operations must execute immediately when intent is clear, not deferred pending user input. The model should have invoked distance/feasibility tools with 'Rivermist' as provided, allowing the backend to handle disambiguation or return partial results.",
